WEBVTT

00:03:27.345 --> 00:03:31.327
is that a Feynman sandwich
had a load of ham,

00:03:31.351 --> 00:03:34.130
but absolutely no baloney.

00:03:35.645 --> 00:03:37.918
What Feynman hated worse
than anything else

00:03:37.942 --> 00:03:39.944
was intellectual pretense --

00:03:39.968 --> 00:03:41.197
phoniness,

00:03:41.221 --> 00:03:43.648
false sophistication, jargon.

00:03:44.950 --> 00:03:49.218
I remember sometime during the mid-'80s,

00:03:49.242 --> 00:03:53.376
Dick and I and Sidney Coleman
would meet a couple of times

00:03:53.400 --> 00:03:56.565
up in San Francisco --
at some very rich guy's house --

00:03:56.589 --> 00:03:58.716
up in San Francisco for dinner.

00:03:58.740 --> 00:04:00.976
And the last time the rich guy invited us,